<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Deliberate breaks against the baseline release, and the reason each is acceptable.

  Empty: there is nothing suppressed against 0.1.0-preview.7.

  Entries here are scoped to the baseline they were generated against, so this file is cleared
  whenever PackageValidationBaselineVersion is raised. A stale suppression silently permits the
  next genuine break in the same type.

  To record an intended break: pack with -p:ApiCompatGenerateSuppressionFile=true, then write down
  next to each entry why it is acceptable.
-->
<Suppressions xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" />
